Package: Rfactor
Title: Rainfall Erosivity Calculations from Precipitation Records
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Adrian",
        family = "Irașoc",
        email = "adrian.irasoc@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9496-5588")
    )
Description:
    Provides tools for calculating rainfall erosivity from
    timestamped precipitation records. The package identifies rainfall events,
    calculates maximum rolling rainfall intensities, rainfall kinetic energy,
    and event EI30 erosivity, and aggregates contributing event erosivity to
    monthly and yearly totals. Storm separation, event omission criteria,
    intensity durations, and rainfall kinetic-energy equations are
    configurable.
